      "sourceText": "- Modules 是 C++20 的新编译模型，替代 `#include`，更快、更安全。\n- `export module` 声明模块名，`export` 标记对外可见的声明。\n- `import` 导入模块（替代 `#include`）。\n- 模块接口单元负责暴露 API，模块实现单元负责隐藏实现。\n- 编译器支持在不断完善中，可以了解但现阶段项目中使用需要评估。\n- 学习 modules 的设计有助于理解大型 C++ 项目的模块化思想。",
      "translatedText": "- Modules are a new compilation model for C++20, replacing `#include`, being faster and safer\\.\n- `export module` declares the module name, and `export` marks declarations visible externally\\.\n- `import` imports modules (replacing `#include`)\\.\n- A module interface unit is responsible for exposing the API, while a module implementation unit is responsible for hiding the implementation\\.\n- Compiler support is continuously improving; it can be understood, but its use in current projects requires evaluation\\.\n- Learning the design of modules helps in understanding the modularization concepts of large C++ projects\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
